  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Army PT Compression Shorts provide the same high-performance benefits of standard Physical Training shorts with the addition of a comfortable and breathable mesh compression inner liner. The APFU (Army Physical Fitness Uniform) shorts feature gold &ldquo;ARMY&rdquo; print on the left leg. The mesh compression inner liner of the running shorts provides additional support during workouts. The athletic shorts feature a moisture wicking and breathable composition to keep you comfortable during intense workouts. The elastic waist is reinforced by a drawstring to secure the workout shorts reliably. The shorts also feature a tagless label for added comfort.&nbsp;</p>",
